" aria-controls="yCk2XtZmb2" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" id="X2_i0Bsp9d" tabindex="0" data-melt-dropdown-menu-trigger=""><button class="btn btn-outlined bg-c-gray-5" title="Copy page"><!--[!--><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide-icon lucide lucide-copy text-c-gray-80 mr-2.5"><!--[--><!----><rect width="14" height="14" x="8" y="8" rx="2" ry="2"><!----></rect><!----><!----><path d="M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2"><!----></path><!----><!--]--><!--[--><!--[--><!--]--><!--]--></svg><!--]--> <span class="text-c-gray-80 text-sm">Copy page</span> <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide-icon lucide lucide-chevron-down text-c-gray-80 ml-1.5"><!--[--><!----><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"><!----></path><!----><!--]--><!--[--><!--[--><!--]--><!--]--></svg><!----></button><!----></span> <!--[!--><!--]--><!--]--><!----></div> <article class="svelte-1g3ym6x"><!--[--><!----><h1 id="cls">Cls</h1>
<div class="runtime-reference-code dual-theme not-prose my-6"><pre class="shiki shiki-themes dark-plus one-light" style="background-color:#1E1E1E;--shiki-light-bg:#FAFAFA;color:#D4D4D4;--shiki-light:#383A42" tabindex="0"><code><span class="line"><span style="color:#569CD6;--shiki-light:#A626A4">class</span><span style="color:#4EC9B0;--shiki-light:#C18401"> Cls</span><span style="color:#D4D4D4;--shiki-light:#C18401">(</span><span style="color:#4EC9B0;--shiki-light:#C18401">modal</span><span style="color:#D4D4D4;--shiki-light:#C18401">.</span><span style="color:#4EC9B0;--shiki-light:#C18401">object</span><span style="color:#D4D4D4;--shiki-light:#C18401">.</span><span style="color:#4EC9B0;--shiki-light:#C18401">Object</span><span style="color:#D4D4D4;--shiki-light:#C18401">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Cls adds method pooling and <a href="https://modal.com/docs/guide/lifecycle-functions">lifecycle hook</a> behavior
to <a href="https://modal.com/docs/sdk/py/latest/Function">modal.Function</a>.</p>
<p>Generally, you will not construct a Cls directly.
Instead, use the <a href="https://modal.com/docs/sdk/py/latest/App#cls"><code>@app.cls()</code></a> decorator on the App object.</p>
<h2 id="hydrate">hydrate</h2>
<div class="runtime-reference-code dual-theme not-prose my-6"><pre class="shiki shiki-themes dark-plus one-light" style="background-color:#1E1E1E;--shiki-light-bg:#FAFAFA;color:#D4D4D4;--shiki-light:#383A42" tabindex="0"><code><span class="line"><span style="color:#D4D4D4;--shiki-light:#383A42">hydrate(</span><span style="color:#569CD6;--shiki-light:#E45649">self</span><span style="color:#D4D4D4;--shiki-light:#383A42">, </span><span style="color:#9CDCFE;--shiki-light:#986801">client</span><span style="color:#D4D4D4;--shiki-light:#383A42">=</span><span style="color:#569CD6;--shiki-light:#986801">None</span><span style="color:#D4D4D4;--shiki-light:#383A42">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Synchronize the local object with its identity on the Modal server.</p>
<p>It is rarely necessary to call this method explicitly, as most operations
will lazily hydrate when needed. The main use case is when you need to
access object metadata, such as its ID.</p>
<p><em>Added in v0.72.39</em>: This method replaces the deprecated <code>.resolve()</code> method.</p>
